OL,18,     Fsentence at Barnhurst. Meg keeps
OL,19,     Fquiet about Latham's illegal
OL,20,     Factivity so she is granted custody
OL,21,     Fof Elizabeth. The women agree to
OL,22,     Flift the barricade.
